(3274117, 457727, 66201, '<td valign="top">Sorry, for no other reason than an extremely personal one, "suicide suggested" photos I find very difficult to look at, and as with every such shot in every challenge, I vote right down. There''s nothing technically bad about this shot, and it does meet the challenge, but I appalls me. I vote instinctively and emotionally to a very large extent on challenges - unfortunately this one hits hard and it will get a low vote from me...but then it''s just one vote....</td>', 'Sorry, for no other reason than an extremely personal one, "suicide suggested" photos I find very difficult to look at, and as with every such shot in every challenge, I vote right down. There''s nothing technically bad about this shot, and it does meet the challenge, but I appalls me. I vote instinctively and emotionally to a very large extent on challenges - unfortunately this one hits hard and it will get a low vote from me...but then it''s just one vote....', '2007-01-24 04:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3274125, 456990, 66201, '<td valign="top">Love the idea: but a side-ways on might have been better...the silhouette is alienating for the viewer and such a large percentage of the image is in darkness... even a 3/4 on shot to give some more light to the subject would have added drama. That scarf could have been given more life streaming out behind the subject: less of a flat image by going from a different angle.</td>', 'Love the idea: but a side-ways on might have been better...the silhouette is alienating for the viewer and such a large percentage of the image is in darkness... even a 3/4 on shot to give some more light to the subject would have added drama. That scarf could have been given more life streaming out behind the subject: less of a flat image by going from a different angle.', '2007-01-24 04:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
