(3282736, 456000, 52130, '<td valign="top">I had this same idea, but bailed out on it. I like the composition, crop, clarity and color saturation. However, I wish there was less motion blur, especially on her face, which has a great expression btw. A faster shutter speed would have helped and then you could have brightened it up later. Also the horizon is just a tad crooked. Other than those few little flaws, a very fun image!</td>', 'I had this same idea, but bailed out on it. I like the composition, crop, clarity and color saturation. However, I wish there was less motion blur, especially on her face, which has a great expression btw. A faster shutter speed would have helped and then you could have brightened it up later. Also the horizon is just a tad crooked. Other than those few little flaws, a very fun image!', '2007-01-25 20:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3282746, 456990, 52130, '<td valign="top">something is just off here and I can''t put my finger on it...and no, I don''t mean the random door on the beach :)<br/>I think I want there to be more light on the shawl and less on her body, sice I can still see the details of her back...hmm, I''m torn.</td>', 'something is just off here and I can''t put my finger on it...and no, I don''t mean the random door on the beach :)I think I want there to be more light on the shawl and less on her body, sice I can still see the details of her back...hmm, I''m torn.', '2007-01-25 20:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3282773, 457030, 52130, '<td valign="top">is this a play on the play? :)<br/> <br/>I love the lighting of the background guy, but I think the girls face should be a little darker (since the light is shown as coming from <i>behind</i> her). Also, her expression is so ''blah'', wile she should look at least <i>a little</i> scared. I''ve seen many high quality photographs brought down by boring expressions of the models. And while I didn''t take off points for that reason, it is something to think about next time you shoot something like this.</td>', 'is this a play on the play? :) I love the lighting of the background guy, but I think the girls face should be a little darker (since the light is shown as coming from behind her). Also, her expression is so ''blah'', wile she should look at least a little scared. I''ve seen many high quality photographs brought down by boring expressions of the models. And while I didn''t take off points for that reason, it is something to think about next time you shoot something like this.', '2007-01-25 20:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
