(3291120, 457577, 70999, '<td valign="top">A shame about the background being so "shaken".  I guess a tripod is little use taking that shot though.  Very nice effect however.</td>', 'A shame about the background being so "shaken".  I guess a tripod is little use taking that shot though.  Very nice effect however.', '2007-01-27 14:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
