(3299347, 456844, 70298, '<td valign="top">Very strong image, must have taken a while to capture!Nice colours.</td>', 'Very strong image, must have taken a while to capture!Nice colours.', '2007-01-29 15:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3299348, 455126, 70298, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot!</td>', 'Beautiful shot!', '2007-01-29 15:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3299352, 456990, 70298, '<td valign="top">very imaginative, well done!</td>', 'very imaginative, well done!', '2007-01-29 15:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3299367, 457767, 70298, '<td valign="top">very good photo,one of the very strong competitors! To be picky it would be good not to have the multicoloured blobs (im amazingly technical...) on the right hand side. Still one of the best tho!</td>', 'very good photo,one of the very strong competitors! To be picky it would be good not to have the multicoloured blobs (im amazingly technical...) on the right hand side. Still one of the best tho!', '2007-01-29 15:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3299535, 455497, 811, '<td valign="top">Yes, it is an exit, so you met the challenge.  It is even quite possibly a creative take on the challenge.  However, the shot itself holds very little photographic merit for me.</td>', 'Yes, it is an exit, so you met the challenge.  It is even quite possibly a creative take on the challenge.  However, the shot itself holds very little photographic merit for me.', '2007-01-29 16:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3299537, 457459, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the different colors, but the shot feels a bit tight to me, horizontally.</td>', 'I like the different colors, but the shot feels a bit tight to me, horizontally.', '2007-01-29 16:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3299540, 457777, 811, '<td valign="top">This is an absolutely beautiful shot, and a good capture.  It stretches the challenge, a bit, I think, but not totally a dnmc.  Without the title, I wouldn''t know if the bird was entering or exiting.</td>', 'This is an absolutely beautiful shot, and a good capture.  It stretches the challenge, a bit, I think, but not totally a dnmc.  Without the title, I wouldn''t know if the bird was entering or exiting.', '2007-01-29 16:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3299547, 456295, 811, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on teh challenge.  Good capture.</td>', 'Interesting take on teh challenge.  Good capture.', '2007-01-29 16:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3299550, 455946, 811, '<td valign="top">Very spooky looking (and slick).</td>', 'Very spooky looking (and slick).', '2007-01-29 16:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3299552, 454679, 811, '<td valign="top">A bit too dark to be truly effective.  I have a (too) bright monitor, so I can see what you were doing with this, but just barely.</td>', 'A bit too dark to be truly effective.  I have a (too) bright monitor, so I can see what you were doing with this, but just barely.', '2007-01-29 16:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3299557, 457512, 811, '<td valign="top">It feels like the cat is falling out of a hole. . ..</td>', 'It feels like the cat is falling out of a hole. . ..', '2007-01-29 16:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3299626, 455587, 811, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and a nice reflection.  I''m sure you had a reason for the narrow crop, but it just doesn''t work for me.  Makes the picture feel cramped and a bit off-balance.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and a nice reflection.  I''m sure you had a reason for the narrow crop, but it just doesn''t work for me.  Makes the picture feel cramped and a bit off-balance.', '2007-01-29 16:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3299636, 457278, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and good capture.  I understand the "exit" part of it, thanks to your title, otherwise, it seems more of an "entry" to me (though I know the comet didn''t actually "enter") because of the way it is framed.</td>', 'Nice shot and good capture.  I understand the "exit" part of it, thanks to your title, otherwise, it seems more of an "entry" to me (though I know the comet didn''t actually "enter") because of the way it is framed.', '2007-01-29 16:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3299640, 456985, 811, '<td valign="top">Would be nice sometimes.  Interesting choice of color and contrast.  Not personally appealing, though I can see the benefit in this shot.</td>', 'Would be nice sometimes.  Interesting choice of color and contrast.  Not personally appealing, though I can see the benefit in this shot.', '2007-01-29 16:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3299646, 457377, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind this, but I am seeing a lot of noise/grain, possibly due to a long exposure (?).</td>', 'I like the idea behind this, but I am seeing a lot of noise/grain, possibly due to a long exposure (?).', '2007-01-29 16:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3299657, 457724, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the color contrast on this</td>', 'I like the color contrast on this', '2007-01-29 16:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3299658, 457760, 811, '<td valign="top">Good composition, and the red gate really adds interest.  Seems a bit soft, focus-wise, though.</td>', 'Good composition, and the red gate really adds interest.  Seems a bit soft, focus-wise, though.', '2007-01-29 16:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3299664, 455475, 811, '<td valign="top">Good exposure and focus.  I also like the perspective you''ve chosen to use.</td>', 'Good exposure and focus.  I also like the perspective you''ve chosen to use.', '2007-01-29 16:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3299665, 455720, 811, '<td valign="top">ouch.</td>', 'ouch.', '2007-01-29 16:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3299671, 457769, 811, '<td valign="top">The person helps to add context, but he seems really really short compared to the door handle and is a bit of distraction.  Otherwise, great exposure and tones on the door.</td>', 'The person helps to add context, but he seems really really short compared to the door handle and is a bit of distraction.  Otherwise, great exposure and tones on the door.', '2007-01-29 16:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3299687, 457517, 811, '<td valign="top">good focus and perspective in this one</td>', 'good focus and perspective in this one', '2007-01-29 16:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3299689, 457385, 66952, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, but seems a bit shoehorned into the challenge, especially since he''s still moving towards the camera.</td>', 'Beautiful, but seems a bit shoehorned into the challenge, especially since he''s still moving towards the camera.', '2007-01-29 16:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3299695, 456986, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the use of shadows in this one, and the colors are awesome.  I would not be surprised to see this on the front page or in top 10</td>', 'I like the use of shadows in this one, and the colors are awesome.  I would not be surprised to see this on the front page or in top 10', '2007-01-29 16:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3299707, 457621, 811, '<td valign="top">Or possibly flying "to" the lake.  Good capture.  There seems to be some of that cursed purple fringing, especially noticeable around the necks.</td>', 'Or possibly flying "to" the lake.  Good capture.  There seems to be some of that cursed purple fringing, especially noticeable around the necks.', '2007-01-29 16:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3299710, 455628, 811, '<td valign="top">Good perspective.  Having the girl barefooted is a very effective detail, I think, though I really couldn''t verbalize why.  It just looks "right."  Also, I like that you have someone actually "exiting" what looks like a gravesite rather than just the grave site itself.</td>', 'Good perspective.  Having the girl barefooted is a very effective detail, I think, though I really couldn''t verbalize why.  It just looks "right."  Also, I like that you have someone actually "exiting" what looks like a gravesite rather than just the grave site itself.', '2007-01-29 16:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3300064, 457512, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like this shot the other way around, but this looks too unnatural and doesn''t seem to relate to exit.</td>', 'I like this shot the other way around, but this looks too unnatural and doesn''t seem to relate to exit.', '2007-01-29 18:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
