(3301331, 456507, 56880, '<td valign="top">I really like how the exit is implied, without having a door in the picture.  The only minor things I see are the thing on the wall behind her head, and the placement of the shoe on the floor leading my eyes out of the picture.</td>', 'I really like how the exit is implied, without having a door in the picture.  The only minor things I see are the thing on the wall behind her head, and the placement of the shoe on the floor leading my eyes out of the picture.', '2007-01-29 23:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
