(3305738, 455720, 68947, '<td valign="top">I love taking photos and the challenge of coming up with a shot and learning.  That''s the reason I''m in here, doing this, but when I see those out there voting 1s and 2s.......unless it''s a DNMC or insulting shot....it''s pathetic to see that some would stoop so low as to vote a 1 or 2 in anything in this site!</td>', 'I love taking photos and the challenge of coming up with a shot and learning.  That''s the reason I''m in here, doing this, but when I see those out there voting 1s and 2s.......unless it''s a DNMC or insulting shot....it''s pathetic to see that some would stoop so low as to vote a 1 or 2 in anything in this site!', '2007-01-31 01:22:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(3305744, 455488, 30982, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  I had you pegged as the hands down blue on this one - I do so love your imagination and envy your ability to execute what you see in your head.  It''s always a delight to see what you can do!</td>', 'Awesome!  I had you pegged as the hands down blue on this one - I do so love your imagination and envy your ability to execute what you see in your head.  It''s always a delight to see what you can do!', '2007-01-31 01:23:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3305748, 455488, 27164, '<td valign="top">Love the surrealist feel to this...Great, just great.</td>', 'Love the surrealist feel to this...Great, just great.', '2007-01-31 01:24:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(3305754, 457459, 53316, '<td valign="top">CONGRATS!! Your second highest score! Very awesome. :-D</td>', 'CONGRATS!! Your second highest score! Very awesome. :-D', '2007-01-31 01:26:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(3305756, 456986, 22301, '<td valign="top">WooHOO! It is so great to see you up on the front page!!! A huge congratulations on your brand new yellow ribbon!!! Thanks for the little nod in your comments, this is wonderful and I love the red. way to go Deb. :)</td>', 'WooHOO! It is so great to see you up on the front page!!! A huge congratulations on your brand new yellow ribbon!!! Thanks for the little nod in your comments, this is wonderful and I love the red. way to go Deb. :)', '2007-01-31 01:27:26.000000', NULL, 0),
