(3306174, 455488, 22301, '<td valign="top">Cole I think you could take any set of props or idea and ribbon with it twice. Twice with one tree, twice magic juggling, twice with one costume. I am awaiting the return of the Ice Princess to the front page :D. Congrats on your red, the photo is amazing.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-31 18:01:36.</i></td>', 'Cole I think you could take any set of props or idea and ribbon with it twice. Twice with one tree, twice magic juggling, twice with one costume. I am awaiting the return of the Ice Princess to the front page :D. Congrats on your red, the photo is amazing.', '2007-01-31 04:05:05.000000', '2007-01-31 18:01:36.000000', 0),
(3306215, 455126, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well not at all surprised this won the challenge, best McNaught photo I have seen ANYWHERE.  Congrat´s!  Would have voted it a big fat 10.</td>', 'Well not at all surprised this won the challenge, best McNaught photo I have seen ANYWHERE.  Congrat´s!  Would have voted it a big fat 10.', '2007-01-31 04:16:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(3306238, 455488, 31443, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! What a story! Jarod is one brave guy..</td>', 'Congratulations! What a story! Jarod is one brave guy..', '2007-01-31 04:22:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(3306266, 455126, 63131, '<td valign="top">It''s so sad that I will never see something that was so brilliant. Your picture leaves me at a loss for words. Perfect in every way.</td>', 'It''s so sad that I will never see something that was so brilliant. Your picture leaves me at a loss for words. Perfect in every way.', '2007-01-31 04:37:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3306274, 456319, 65649, '<td valign="top">You''re right, it''s far too soft. The light was pretty awful and I was rushed so it ended up being a handheld shot with a slow shutter speed (and it was cold, that never makes it easy to keep things steady).<br/> <br/>I''m surprised I got the result I got.<br/> <br/>As for levels and saturation, how would you tweak them?</td>', 'You''re right, it''s far too soft. The light was pretty awful and I was rushed so it ended up being a handheld shot with a slow shutter speed (and it was cold, that never makes it easy to keep things steady). I''m surprised I got the result I got. As for levels and saturation, how would you tweak them?', '2007-01-31 04:39:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3306322, 456985, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very creative, Chele!  You got your point across to me, anyway - nice work, both the photography and the sketch.</td>', 'Very creative, Chele!  You got your point across to me, anyway - nice work, both the photography and the sketch.', '2007-01-31 04:59:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3306324, 455488, 45115, '<td valign="top">carry in with the fantastic work coley, I''m luvin'' it!</td>', 'carry in with the fantastic work coley, I''m luvin'' it!', '2007-01-31 05:00:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(3306326, 455126, 22301, '<td valign="top">Congrats John, this shot is definitely better than what I have seen in print. Thought you might like <a href="//dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=461799" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this</a> from the site favorites page. A well deserved blue.</td>', 'Congrats John, this shot is definitely better than what I have seen in print. Thought you might like this from the site favorites page. A well deserved blue.', '2007-01-31 05:00:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3306353, 457606, 20608, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, should be higher of cause. I feel maybe if it had more tonal quality it would of placed right up there.. the idea is top class<br/> <br/>well done team buddy</td>', 'Nice shot, should be higher of cause. I feel maybe if it had more tonal quality it would of placed right up there.. the idea is top class well done team buddy', '2007-01-31 05:13:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(3306365, 456986, 70661, '<td valign="top">Congrats! Great shot!</td>', 'Congrats! Great shot!', '2007-01-31 05:17:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(3306366, 455488, 47721, '<td valign="top">Hey Coley, <br/> <br/>You did it again... I''m your aunt "Pauline''s best photographe freind" ... She''s so proud of you...<br/> <br/>Congrats for your work and your fantastic imagination...</td>', 'Hey Coley,  You did it again... I''m your aunt "Pauline''s best photographe freind" ... She''s so proud of you... Congrats for your work and your fantastic imagination...', '2007-01-31 05:17:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(3306380, 455126, 27845, '<td valign="top">This is really impressive. Congratulations on this one-in-a-million picture.</td>', 'This is really impressive. Congratulations on this one-in-a-million picture.', '2007-01-31 05:22:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(3306389, 455126, 35044, '<td valign="top">Congrats!  As I am sure you are aware, this pic (on Flickr) was dug earlier this week on <a href="//www.digg.com" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.digg.com</a> . Very cool!</td>', 'Congrats!  As I am sure you are aware, this pic (on Flickr) was dug earlier this week on //www.digg.com . Very cool!', '2007-01-31 05:27:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3306404, 455488, 51538, '<td valign="top">That''s some buddy and not even any royalties to share ;-)  I could not quite figure out how the shot was done, so the set up worked very well.</td>', 'That''s some buddy and not even any royalties to share ;-)  I could not quite figure out how the shot was done, so the set up worked very well.', '2007-01-31 05:34:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(3306406, 456986, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.  I stayed in Wiesbaden many years back when I was attending the Frankfurt Buchemesse (as I did every year for 15 years).  It is a very pleasant town.</td>', 'Lovely shot.  I stayed in Wiesbaden many years back when I was attending the Frankfurt Buchemesse (as I did every year for 15 years).  It is a very pleasant town.', '2007-01-31 05:35:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3306409, 455126, 72144, '<td valign="top">Superb!! I only aspire to catch a scene as beautiful as this! I cant believe you took it in SA! Vunderbah!</td>', 'Superb!! I only aspire to catch a scene as beautiful as this! I cant believe you took it in SA! Vunderbah!', '2007-01-31 05:37:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3306414, 455587, 51538, '<td valign="top">Still think this is a very nice submission.  Ignore the other comments... ;-)</td>', 'Still think this is a very nice submission.  Ignore the other comments... ;-)', '2007-01-31 05:41:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3306423, 455644, 70999, '<td valign="top">I think you were hard done by!  As per my comment during the challenge the border distracted me (2px of white on bottom/right but only one on top/left, looks a bit weird to me) but that was only enough to knock you down to 8, I loved the shot.<br/> <br/>The "exit" is admittedly small but the bold outline grabs your attention so you can hardly say it''s tenuous.<br/></td>', 'I think you were hard done by!  As per my comment during the challenge the border distracted me (2px of white on bottom/right but only one on top/left, looks a bit weird to me) but that was only enough to knock you down to 8, I loved the shot. The "exit" is admittedly small but the bold outline grabs your attention so you can hardly say it''s tenuous.', '2007-01-31 05:50:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(3306424, 457119, 50674, '<td valign="top">A fantastic shot becky. The colours are truly beautiful, composition is great ... an elegant shot.</td>', 'A fantastic shot becky. The colours are truly beautiful, composition is great ... an elegant shot.', '2007-01-31 05:50:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(3306433, 456507, 70999, '<td valign="top">Agree with meyers, I think you were very hard done by with this.<br/></td>', 'Agree with meyers, I think you were very hard done by with this.', '2007-01-31 05:54:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(3306448, 456986, 65886, '<td valign="top">yohooo!!! congrats Deb, really cool photo!</td>', 'yohooo!!! congrats Deb, really cool photo!', '2007-01-31 05:58:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3306453, 455488, 56978, '<td valign="top">Excellent job, especially in Basic Editing...looks somewhat dangerous so it''ll hopefully remain one of a kind!</td>', 'Excellent job, especially in Basic Editing...looks somewhat dangerous so it''ll hopefully remain one of a kind!', '2007-01-31 06:03:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3306465, 457637, 70999, '<td valign="top">I think you were a hard done by here.  Yes it''s not very wide, but I don''t think adding more to the left or right would help the picture - and you''ve used the full vertical resolution.<br/> <br/>I can''t help feeling people have voted this down for the subject matter which is sad since it clearly meets the challenge and in an original way.<br/></td>', 'I think you were a hard done by here.  Yes it''s not very wide, but I don''t think adding more to the left or right would help the picture - and you''ve used the full vertical resolution. I can''t help feeling people have voted this down for the subject matter which is sad since it clearly meets the challenge and in an original way.', '2007-01-31 06:08:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3306468, 456378, 70999, '<td valign="top">Sorry I didn''t comment during the challenge, I liked the idea but wasn''t fond of the processing - a delicate subject requires delicate processing sometimes.  I think you have attracted the ire of both the anti-processing crowd and the anti-nudity crowd :(.<br/></td>', 'Sorry I didn''t comment during the challenge, I liked the idea but wasn''t fond of the processing - a delicate subject requires delicate processing sometimes.  I think you have attracted the ire of both the anti-processing crowd and the anti-nudity crowd :(.', '2007-01-31 06:11:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(3306476, 457708, 70999, '<td valign="top">As others have said, the subject isn''t very well isolated which is a problem since the background isn''t contributing.  Some combination of being closer to the subject, using a lower f-stop and cropping more would help with that.<br/> <br/>Also I''m sorry but I think that this image doesn''t really meet the challenge.  Of course death is an exit but a gravestone is pretty far removed from that.  The wrong side of the divide between originality and shoehorning, in my opinion.<br/></td>', 'As others have said, the subject isn''t very well isolated which is a problem since the background isn''t contributing.  Some combination of being closer to the subject, using a lower f-stop and cropping more would help with that. Also I''m sorry but I think that this image doesn''t really meet the challenge.  Of course death is an exit but a gravestone is pretty far removed from that.  The wrong side of the divide between originality and shoehorning, in my opinion.', '2007-01-31 06:17:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(3306477, 455126, 41337, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!</td>', 'Fantastic!', '2007-01-31 06:17:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3306478, 456986, 41047, '<td valign="top">woohoo, yellow ribbon! congratulations deb, beautiful capture.</td>', 'woohoo, yellow ribbon! congratulations deb, beautiful capture.', '2007-01-31 06:18:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3306482, 457447, 70999, '<td valign="top">This was a good opportunist shot, I think you were hard done by in the voting.</td>', 'This was a good opportunist shot, I think you were hard done by in the voting.', '2007-01-31 06:19:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(3306485, 456986, 40797, '<td valign="top">WOOOOO HOOOOOOO, YES !!!!! I am doing my happy dance!  Deb, this is fantastic!!! I love the shadows. I am so happy that you left them in. It makes for a much more interesting image IMO. Congratulations on your ribbon.</td>', 'WOOOOO HOOOOOOO, YES !!!!! I am doing my happy dance!  Deb, this is fantastic!!! I love the shadows. I am so happy that you left them in. It makes for a much more interesting image IMO. Congratulations on your ribbon.', '2007-01-31 06:19:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3306492, 455488, 41337, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the red. I can''t imagine asking anybody to jump up and down on an icy roof. I don''t suppose you have a shot entered in the free study of him falling off? :P</td>', 'Congrats on the red. I can''t imagine asking anybody to jump up and down on an icy roof. I don''t suppose you have a shot entered in the free study of him falling off? :P', '2007-01-31 06:21:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(3306493, 455126, 48479, '<td valign="top">that''s amazing. congratulations</td>', 'that''s amazing. congratulations', '2007-01-31 06:21:38.000000', NULL, 0),
