(3306557, 456986, 56797, '<td valign="top">Congrats!<br/></td>', 'Congrats!', '2007-01-31 07:05:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3306604, 456986, 23484, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot Deb. Congratulations on the ribbon.  You certainly deserve it.  I love the colors. The silver and the rust just go together so well. Not to mention, great use of rule of thirds.</td>', 'Excellent shot Deb. Congratulations on the ribbon.  You certainly deserve it.  I love the colors. The silver and the rust just go together so well. Not to mention, great use of rule of thirds.', '2007-01-31 07:24:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3306623, 457447, 41206, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the great feedback! I knew I had a good ''exit'' photo, and I also knew I needed an EXIT sign to prove this was really an exit. Where I erred was that you DP-ers would assume the load fell off the truck as it made a sharp turn (exiting). Sometimes these news photos require a little thought from the viewers.<br/> <br/>AND...since I was in traffic, and made this through the window of my car, I really felt the realism would give this image more than 2 tens! (Thanks to you two for those tens!!)<br/> <br/>Perhaps we need a contest to make images of traffic/ spontaneous images of the real world, from our cars!!!...mmmmm?</td>', 'Thanks for the great feedback! I knew I had a good ''exit'' photo, and I also knew I needed an EXIT sign to prove this was really an exit. Where I erred was that you DP-ers would assume the load fell off the truck as it made a sharp turn (exiting). Sometimes these news photos require a little thought from the viewers. AND...since I was in traffic, and made this through the window of my car, I really felt the realism would give this image more than 2 tens! (Thanks to you two for those tens!!) Perhaps we need a contest to make images of traffic/ spontaneous images of the real world, from our cars!!!...mmmmm?', '2007-01-31 07:30:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3306632, 455126, 25787, '<td valign="top">Spectacular</td>', 'Spectacular', '2007-01-31 07:32:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(3306699, 456986, 66597, '<td valign="top">Oh, Deb! I am so happy for you! Congratulations!!! This is a wonderful shot and this ribbon is richly deserved. The colors and shadow interplay are superb. My favorite part? This is obviously not overly photoshopped. I like it much better with the tree included.</td>', 'Oh, Deb! I am so happy for you! Congratulations!!! This is a wonderful shot and this ribbon is richly deserved. The colors and shadow interplay are superb. My favorite part? This is obviously not overly photoshopped. I like it much better with the tree included.', '2007-01-31 07:50:39.000000', NULL, 0),
