(3308583, 456986, 40370, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your first ribbon, thought I might like your outake better but once opened realized the rich color wasn''t there and the windows aren''t as dramatic, your instinct got you the ribbon. Nice.</td>', 'Congrats on your first ribbon, thought I might like your outake better but once opened realized the rich color wasn''t there and the windows aren''t as dramatic, your instinct got you the ribbon. Nice.', '2007-01-31 14:17:26.000000', NULL, 0),
