(3316533, 454611, 50695, '<td valign="top">beautiful!</td>', 'beautiful!', '2007-02-01 23:36:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(3316754, 457754, 42100, '<td valign="top">Well this photo definitely connected with me, I apparantly was your only ten.  While I didn''t expect this to win, I am thoroughly shocked and stunned that this scored so low.  I think it is very creative and imaginative with very good technicals, and is something of which you should be proud.  Keep up the good work!<br/> <br/>Just read some of the comments...not really sure why so many thought the cat needed to be in focus, I think that gives this photo a good and interesting tension.</td>', 'Well this photo definitely connected with me, I apparantly was your only ten.  While I didn''t expect this to win, I am thoroughly shocked and stunned that this scored so low.  I think it is very creative and imaginative with very good technicals, and is something of which you should be proud.  Keep up the good work! Just read some of the comments...not really sure why so many thought the cat needed to be in focus, I think that gives this photo a good and interesting tension.', '2007-02-02 00:05:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(3316771, 455126, 11843, '<td valign="top">Holy crap! Congrats on your blue! Awesome once in a lifetime shot.</td>', 'Holy crap! Congrats on your blue! Awesome once in a lifetime shot.', '2007-02-02 00:10:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(3317296, 455644, 26669, '<td valign="top">thanks for the comments, the border is strange, I increase the canvas size all round by the same px width yet it always looks like i have botched it up?<br/> <br/>Is this a common problem?</td>', 'thanks for the comments, the border is strange, I increase the canvas size all round by the same px width yet it always looks like i have botched it up? Is this a common problem?', '2007-02-02 02:32:37.000000', NULL, 0),
