(3324219, 455488, 36988, '<td valign="top">Hey Cole. Here you are once again proving that when you mix imagination with amazing talent, wonderful things happen. Outstanding work as always!</td>', 'Hey Cole. Here you are once again proving that when you mix imagination with amazing talent, wonderful things happen. Outstanding work as always!', '2007-02-03 21:00:15.000000', NULL, 0),
