(3331064, 455126, 42100, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photograph of the comet, love how you captured the tail.  Congratulations on winning the blue ribbon and your other successes coming with the photo.</td>', 'Beautiful photograph of the comet, love how you captured the tail.  Congratulations on winning the blue ribbon and your other successes coming with the photo.', '2007-02-05 14:08:02.000000', NULL, 0),
