(3335534, 455126, 14156, '<td valign="top">I couldn''t see this comet very well from where I live, which is in southern New Mexico. I kept hearing reports about how spectacular it was and now I get to see it in this picture.</td>', 'I couldn''t see this comet very well from where I live, which is in southern New Mexico. I kept hearing reports about how spectacular it was and now I get to see it in this picture.', '2007-02-06 16:16:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(3341154, 456183, 7810, '<td valign="top">I really liked this shot. Congrats on the high finish. The tones, the blur, the model ... all good  well done.</td>', 'I really liked this shot. Congrats on the high finish. The tones, the blur, the model ... all good  well done.', '2007-02-07 19:12:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3341510, 456183, 23484, '<td valign="top">Great shot Terry. The sepia tone really enhances this image. color would not have worked nearly as well. Nice to see somebody else from Mid-Michigan on DPC.</td>', 'Great shot Terry. The sepia tone really enhances this image. color would not have worked nearly as well. Nice to see somebody else from Mid-Michigan on DPC.', '2007-02-07 20:56:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3343507, 455720, 64733, '<td valign="top">i didn''t get a chance to vote on this one, but i think this is very well shot, staged, and acted.<br/> <br/>nice work!</td>', 'i didn''t get a chance to vote on this one, but i think this is very well shot, staged, and acted. nice work!', '2007-02-08 10:04:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(3343576, 455286, 11854, '<td valign="top">This is a very emotive shot! I absolutely love it. I would imagine this is how it feels to have a mental illness. I know that depression sometimes makes me feel this way. On another note... I wouldn''t put the rules used in the title. There are many people who will deduct points for that and that might have hurt you here. IMHO, this should have scored higher.</td>', 'This is a very emotive shot! I absolutely love it. I would imagine this is how it feels to have a mental illness. I know that depression sometimes makes me feel this way. On another note... I wouldn''t put the rules used in the title. There are many people who will deduct points for that and that might have hurt you here. IMHO, this should have scored higher.', '2007-02-08 10:31:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(3347202, 456183, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is SO GREAT!  Photojournalism at its finest.  She is such a striking character.  Very pretty -- almost flaunting the fact that she doesn''t need fine dress or $100 hair cuts -- her flawless beauty is evident no matter what!<br/> <br/>I love this photo!<br/> <br/></td>', 'This is SO GREAT!  Photojournalism at its finest.  She is such a striking character.  Very pretty -- almost flaunting the fact that she doesn''t need fine dress or $100 hair cuts -- her flawless beauty is evident no matter what! I love this photo! ', '2007-02-09 10:43:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(3349811, 457684, 55600, '<td valign="top">yep, sucks!</td>', 'yep, sucks!', '2007-02-10 02:04:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3354599, 455488, 43463, '<td valign="top">I Love the play on the title!!! Very creative and warped sense of humor:-)"Murray''s" pose is perfect with the very small exception that his feet are not all the way turned out like in many of the Mary Poppins illustrations;-) Nonetheless, even without the title, the image STILL strongly invokes the idea of the childhood classic Mary Poppins. Love the expression on Murray''s face as he catches the west wind to take flight. I can hear his voice stating in a crisp and proper tone (like Julie Andrews  Poppins) "Tis quite a good day for flying. Close your mouth you are not a cod fish. Now carry on with your business. Spit Spot!" Again the sepia tone was a good choice for it adds to an old time nostaligic feel to the photo.</td>', 'I Love the play on the title!!! Very creative and warped sense of humor:-)"Murray''s" pose is perfect with the very small exception that his feet are not all the way turned out like in many of the Mary Poppins illustrations;-) Nonetheless, even without the title, the image STILL strongly invokes the idea of the childhood classic Mary Poppins. Love the expression on Murray''s face as he catches the west wind to take flight. I can hear his voice stating in a crisp and proper tone (like Julie Andrews  Poppins) "Tis quite a good day for flying. Close your mouth you are not a cod fish. Now carry on with your business. Spit Spot!" Again the sepia tone was a good choice for it adds to an old time nostaligic feel to the photo.', '2007-02-11 21:53:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(3359521, 456981, 60862, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the personal best.  That''s always a good thing!<br/> <br/>I like your composition here and the color''s great. :)</td>', 'Congrats on the personal best.  That''s always a good thing! I like your composition here and the color''s great. :)', '2007-02-12 23:46:02.000000', NULL, 0),
