(3447112, 457307, 73575, '<td valign="top">I really like the mood and composition here. Definately a great take on the challenge; great darkness into light feeling. However it feels like it''s off-balance; I can see how the shadows might not be horizontal, but she seems to be falling over. I think this would look much nicer rotated upright, and crop the top and bottom about 10% each (also a smidgeon off the right).</td>', 'I really like the mood and composition here. Definately a great take on the challenge; great darkness into light feeling. However it feels like it''s off-balance; I can see how the shadows might not be horizontal, but she seems to be falling over. I think this would look much nicer rotated upright, and crop the top and bottom about 10% each (also a smidgeon off the right).', '2007-03-09 17:47:50.000000', NULL, 0),
