(4993661, 456183, 69008, '<td valign="top">Excellent! Been there, done that, and it was a great education in human character.  Two of us played music and lived in the Owasso/Chesaning area for about 6 months on the streets in a van.  We left in a blizzard in Jan 74.  It takes faith to be on the road like that with no security at all.</td>', 'Excellent! Been there, done that, and it was a great education in human character.  Two of us played music and lived in the Owasso/Chesaning area for about 6 months on the streets in a van.  We left in a blizzard in Jan 74.  It takes faith to be on the road like that with no security at all.', '2008-10-05 20:01:07.000000', NULL, 0),
